@comment{
  abstraction.wiki shared bibliography (BibTeX / BibLaTeX).
  Cite an entry in any page by its key in square brackets, with an at-sign before the key;
  see content/about/authoring.md. Edit by hand or export from a reference manager
  (e.g. Zotero + Better BibTeX, "Keep updated"). Seed entries: works already cited in the essays.
  Parser limits: no at-signs inside comments, and no bare percent-sign comment lines.
  A publisher containing "and" needs double braces, e.g. {{Williams and Norgate}}.
}

